<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title>Form 990 Template</title>
<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, sans-serif;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-bottom: 15px; }
  td, th { padding: 5px; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; }
  .header-section { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; margin-bottom: 20px; }
  .form-title { font-size: 16pt; font-weight: bold; }
  .section-header { font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .line-item-row td:first-child { width: 5%; }
  .line-item-row td:nth-child(2) { width: 20%; }
  .line-item-row td:nth-child(3) { width: 15%; }
  .line-item-row td:nth-child(4) { width: 15%; }
  .line-item-row td:nth-child(5) { width: 25%; }
  .line-item-row td:nth-child(6) { width: 20%; }
</style>

<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, sans-serif;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  td {
    padding: 5px 0;
    vertical-align: top;
  }
  .header-row td {
    font-weight: bold;
  }
  .section-title {
    font-weight: bold;
    margin-top: 15px;
    margin-bottom: 5px;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="page">
  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start;">
    <div>
      <div class="form-title">Form 990</div>
      <div style="margin-top: 10px;">
        <p><strong>Part I</strong></p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div style="text-align: right;">
      <div style="font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;">OMB No. 1545-0047</div>
      <div style="font-size: 24pt; font-weight: bold;">20<span data-field="tax_year_end_year">{{ tax_year_end_year }}</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <p><strong>Part I</strong></p>
    <p><strong>Return of Organization Exempt From Income Tax</strong></p>
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Under section 501(c)(3), 527, or 4947(a)(1) of the Internal Revenue Code (except black lung benefit trust or private foundation)</p>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
    <p><strong>A</strong> For the <span data-field="tax_year_start_date">{{ tax_year_start_date }}</span> calendar year, or tax year beginning <span data-field="tax_year_start_date_month">{{ tax_year_start_date_month }}</span> <span data-field="tax_year_start_date_day">{{ tax_year_start_date_day }}</span>, <span data-field="tax_year_end_date">{{ tax_year_end_date }}</span>, and ending <span data-field="tax_year_end_date">{{ tax_year_end_date }}</span> <span data-field="tax_year_end_date_day">{{ tax_year_end_date_day }}</span></p>
  </div>

  <table style="margin-top: 20px;">
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 5%;"><strong>B</strong> Check if applicable:</td>
      <td style="width: 30%;">
        <span data-field="organization_name">{{ organization_name }}</span>
        <br>
        <span data-field="organization_address_line1">{{ organization_address_line1 }}</span>
        <br>
        <span data-field="organization_city_state_zip">{{ organization_city_state_zip }}</span>
      </td>
      <td style="width: 15%;">
        <span data-field="EIN">{{ ein }}</span>
        <br>
        <span data-field="organization_phone">{{ organization_phone }}</span>
      </td>
      <td style="width: 15%;">
        <span data-field="form_type">{{ form_type }}</span>
        <br>
        <span data-field="filing_status">{{ filing_status }}</span>
      </td>
      <td style="width: 25%;">
        <span data-field="submission_date">{{ submission_date }}</span>
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
    <p><strong>C</strong> Name and address of organization: <span data-field="organization_name">{{ organization_name }}</span>, <span data-field="organization_address_line1">{{ organization_address_line1 }}</span>, <span data-field="organization_city_state_zip">{{ organization_city_state_zip }}</span></p>
    <p><strong>D</strong> Employer identification number: <span data-field="ein">{{ ein }}</span></p>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
    <p><strong>E</strong> Telephone number: <span data-field="organization_phone">{{ organization_phone }}</span></p>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
    <p><strong>F</strong> Check if applicable: <span data-field="is_tax_exempt_status">{{ is_tax_exempt_status }}</span></p>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
    <p><strong>G</strong> Gross receipts: <span data-field="gross_receipts">{{ gross_receipts }}</span></p>
    <p><strong>H</strong> Is this a group return for affiliates? <span data-field="is_group_return">{{ is_group_return }}</span></p>
    <p><strong>I</strong> Are all affiliates included? <span data-field="are_all_affiliates_included">{{ are_all_affiliates_included }}</span></p>
    <p><strong>J</strong> If "No," attach a list. <span data-field="attach_list_flag">{{ attach_list_flag }}</span></p>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
    <p><strong>K</strong> Exempt organization number: <span data-field="exempt_org_number">{{ exempt_org_number }}</span></p>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <div class="section-header">Summary</div>
    <p><strong>1</strong> Briefly describe the organization's mission or most significant activities. <span data-field="mission_statement">{{ mission_statement }}</span></p>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <div class="section-header">Expenses</div>
    <table style="width: 100%;">
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th style="width: 5%;"></th>
          <th style="width: 20%;">Description</th>
          <th style="width: 15%;">Amount</th>
          <th style="width: 15%;">Amount</th>
          <th style="width: 25%;">Amount</th>
          <th style="width: 20%;">Amount</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr class="line-item-row">
          <td><strong>1</strong></td>
          <td><span data-field="expense_description_1">{{ expense_description_1 }}</span></td>
          <td><span data-field="expense_amount_1_col_1">{{ expense_amount_1_col_1 }}</span></td>
          <td><span data-field="expense_amount_1_col_2">{{ expense_amount_1_col_2 }}</span></td>
          <td><span data-field="expense_amount_1_col_3">{{ expense_amount_1_col_3 }}</span></td>
          <td><span data-field="expense_amount_1_col_4">{{ expense_amount_1_col_4 }}</span></td>
        </tr>
        <!-- More line items would go here if the structure allowed for dynamic rows -->
      </tbody>
    </table>
    <p><strong>Total expenses:</strong> <span data-field="total_expenses">{{ total_expenses }}</span></p>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <div class="section-header">Part II</div>
    <p><strong>Checklist of Required Schedules</strong></p>
    <table style="width: 100%;">
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th style="width: 5%;"></th>
          <th style="width: 40%;">Description</th>
          <th style="width: 10%;">Yes</th>
          <th style="width: 10%;">No</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr class="line-item-row">
          <td><strong>1</strong></td>
          <td>Is the organization described in section 501(c)(3) or 4947(a)(1) (other than a private foundation)? If "Yes," complete Schedule A.</td>
          <td><span data-field="schedule_a_check_1">{{ schedule_a_check_1 }}</span></td>
          <td><span data-field="schedule_a_check_1_no">{{ schedule_a_check_1_no }}</span></td>
        </tr>
        <tr class="line-item-row">
          <td><strong>2</strong></td>
          <td>Is the organization required to complete Schedule B, Schedule of Contributors? (see instructions)</td>
          <td><span data-field="schedule_b_check_2">{{ schedule_b_check_2 }}</span></td>
          <td><span data-field="schedule_b_check_2_no">{{ schedule_b_check_2_no }}</span></td>
        </tr>
        <tr class="line-item-row">
          <td><strong>3</strong></td>
          <td>Did the organization engage in direct or indirect political campaign activities on behalf of or in opposition to any candidate for public office? If "Yes," complete Schedule C.</td>
          <td><span data-field="schedule_c_check_3">{{ schedule_c_check_3 }}</span></td>
          <td><span data-field="schedule_c_check_3_no">{{ schedule_c_check_3_no }}</span></td>
        </tr>
        <tr class="line-item-row">
          <td><strong>4</strong></td>
          <td>Did the organization engage in lobbying activities? If "Yes," complete Schedule C.</td>
          <td><span data-field="schedule_c_check_4">{{ schedule_c_check_4 }}</span></td>
          <td><span data-field="schedule_c_check_4_no">{{ schedule_c_check_4_no }}</span></td>
        </tr>
        <tr class="line-item-row">
          <td><strong>5</strong></td>
          <td>Is the organization a section 501(c)(3), 501(c)(5), or 501(c)(6) organization that receives membership dues, assessments, or similar amounts as defined in Revenue Procedure 98-197? If "Yes," complete Schedule C, Part III.</td>
          <td><span data-field="schedule_c_check_5">{{ schedule_c_check_5 }}</span></td>
          <td><span data-field="schedule_c_check_5_no">{{ schedule_c_check_5_no }}</span></td>
        </tr>
        <tr class="line-item-row">
          <td><strong>6</strong></td>
          <td>Did the organization maintain any donor advised funds or any similar funds or accounts where donors have the right to provide advice on the distribution or investment of amounts in such funds or accounts? If "Yes," complete Schedule D, Part I.</td>
          <td><span data-field="schedule_d_check_6">{{ schedule_d_check_6 }}</span></td>
          <td><span data-field="schedule_d_check_6_no">{{ schedule_d_check_6_no }}</span></td>
        </tr>
        <tr class="line-item-row">
          <td><strong>7</strong></td>
          <td>Did the organization receive or hold a conservation easement, including easements to preserve open space, the environment, historic land areas, or historic structures? If "Yes," complete Schedule D, Part II.</td>
          <td><span data-field="schedule_d_check_7">{{ schedule_d_check_7 }}</span></td>
          <td><span data-field="schedule_d_check_7_no">{{ schedule_d_check_7_no }}</span></td>
        </tr>
        <tr class="line-item-row">
          <td><strong>8</strong></td>
          <td>Did the organization maintain collections of works of art, historical treasures, or other similar assets? If "Yes," complete Schedule D, Part III.</td>
          <td><span data-field="schedule_d_check_8">{{ schedule_d_check_8 }}</span></td>
          <td><span data-field="schedule_d_check_8_no">{{ schedule_d_check_8_no }}</span></td>
        </tr>
        <tr class="line-item-row">
          <td><strong>9</strong></td>
          <td>Did the organization report an amount in Part X, line 21; serve as a custodian for amounts not listed in Part X; or provide credit counseling, debt management, credit repair, or debt negotiation services? If "Yes," complete Schedule E.</td>
          <td><span data-field="schedule_e_check_9">{{ schedule_e_check_9 }}</span></td>
          <td><span data-field="schedule_e_check_9_no">{{ schedule_e_check_9_no }}</span></td>
        </tr>
        <tr class="line-item-row">
          <td><strong>10</strong></td>
          <td>Did the organization directly or through a related organization, hold assets in term, permanent, or quasi-endowment? If "Yes," complete Schedule D, Part V.</td>
          <td><span data-field="schedule_d_check_10">{{ schedule_d_check_10 }}</span></td>
          <td><span data-field="schedule_d_check_10_no">{{ schedule_d_check_10_no }}</span></td>
        </tr>
        <tr class="line-item-row">
          <td><strong>11</strong></td>
          <td>If the organization's assets are subject to a charitable trust, is the trust governed by a trust instrument? If "Yes," complete Schedule D, Parts VI, VII, VIII, IX, or X as applicable.</td>
          <td><span data-field="schedule_d_check_11">{{ schedule_d_check_11 }}</span></td>
          <td><span data-field="schedule_d_check_11_no">{{ schedule_d_check_11_no }}</span></td>
        </tr>
        <tr class="line-item-row">
          <td><strong>12</strong></td>
          <td>Did the organization receive any grant or contribution from a government entity? If "Yes," complete Schedule G.</td>
          <td><span data-field="schedule_g_check_12">{{ schedule_g_check_12 }}</span></td>
          <td><span data-field="schedule_g_check_12_no">{{ schedule_g_check_12_no }}</span></td>
        </tr>
        <tr class="line-item-row">
          <td><strong>13</strong></td>
          <td>Did the organization maintain an office, employees, or agents outside the United States? If "Yes," complete Schedule F.</td>
          <td><span data-field="schedule_f_check_13">{{ schedule_f_check_13 }}</span></td>
          <td><span data-field="schedule_f_check_13_no">{{ schedule_f_check_13_no }}</span></td>
        </tr>
        <tr class="line-item-row">
          <td><strong>14</strong></td>
          <td>Did the organization have aggregate revenues or expenses of more than $5,000 in any of the following categories: (a) grants or assistance to any organization or entity located outside the United States? (b) grants or assistance to any organization or entity located outside the United States?</td>
          <td><span data-field="schedule_f_check_14">{{ schedule_f_check_14 }}</span></td>
          <td><span data-field="schedule_f_check_14_no">{{ schedule_f_check_14_no }}</span></td>
        </tr>
        <tr class="line-item-row">
          <td><strong>15</strong></td>
          <td>Did the organization report on Part IX, column (A), line 3, more than $5,000 of grants or assistance to any organization or entity located outside the United States? If "Yes," complete Schedule F, Parts III and IV.</td>
          <td><span data-field="schedule_f_check_15">{{ schedule_f_check_15 }}</span></td>
          <td><span data-field="schedule_f_check_15_no">{{ schedule_f_check_15_no }}</span></td>
        </tr>
        <tr class="line-item-row">
          <td><strong>16</strong></td>
          <td>Did the organization report on Part IX, column (A), line 3, more than $5,000 of grants or assistance to any organization or entity located outside the United States? If "Yes," complete Schedule F, Parts III and IV.</td>
          <td><span data-field="schedule_f_check_16">{{ schedule_f_check_16 }}</span></td>
          <td><span data-field="schedule_f_check_16_no">{{ schedule_f_check_16_no }}</span></td>
        </tr>
        <tr class="line-item-row">
          <td><strong>17</strong></td>
          <td>Did the organization have more than 10% of its total assets invested in equity securities? If "Yes," complete Schedule G, Part I.</td>
          <td><span data-field="schedule_g_check_17">{{ schedule_g_check_17 }}</span></td>
          <td><span data-field="schedule_g_check_17_no">{{ schedule_g_check_17_no }}</span></td>
        </tr>
        <tr class="line-item-row">
          <td><strong>18</strong></td>
          <td>Did the organization report more than $15,000 of gross income from gaming activities on Part VIII, line 9a? If "Yes," complete Schedule G, Part III.</td>
          <td><span data-field="schedule_g_check_18">{{ schedule_g_check_18 }}</span></td>
          <td><span data-field="schedule_g_check_18_no">{{ schedule_g_check_18_no }}</span></td>
        </tr>
        <tr class="line-item-row">
          <td><strong>19</strong></td>
          <td>Did the organization operate one or more hospitals? If "Yes," complete Schedule H.</td>
          <td><span data-field="schedule_h_check_19">{{ schedule_h_check_19 }}</span></td>
          <td><span data-field="schedule_h_check_19_no">{{ schedule_h_check_19_no }}</span></td>
        </tr>
        <tr class="line-item-row">
          <td><strong>20</strong></td>
          <td>If "Yes" to line 20a, did the organization attach its audited financial statements to this return? Note: Some Form 990 filers that operate one or more hospitals must attach audited financial statements (see instructions).</td>
          <td><span data-field="schedule_h_check_20">{{ schedule_h_check_20 }}</span></td>
          <td><span data-field="schedule_h_check_20_no">{{ schedule_h_check_20_no }}</span></td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <div class="section-header">Signature Block</div>
    <table style="width: 100%;">
      <tr>
        <td style="width: 30%;">Sign Here</td>
        <td style="width: 30%;">Signature of officer</td>
        <td style="width: 20%;">Date</td>
        <td style="width: 20%;">PTIN</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td colspan="4" style="padding-top: 10px;">
          <p>Type or print name and title: <span data-field="signer_name">{{ signer_name }}</span></p>
          <p>Preparer's signature: <span data-field="preparer_signature">{{ preparer_signature }}</span></p>
          <p>Date: <span data-field="preparer_date">{{ preparer_date }}</span></p>
          <p>Check if self-employed: <span data-field="self_employed_check">{{ self_employed_check }}</span></p>
        </td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <p><strong>Paid Preparer</strong></p>
    <p>Name: <span data-field="paid_preparer_name">{{ paid_preparer_name }}</span></p>
    <p>Firm's name: <span data-field="paid_preparer_firm_name">{{ paid_preparer_firm_name }}</span></p>
    <p>Address: <span data-field="paid_preparer_address">{{ paid_preparer_address }}</span></p>
    <p>Phone: <span data-field="paid_preparer_phone">{{ paid_preparer_phone }}</span></p>
  </div>

</div>

<div class="page">
  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start;">
    <div>
      <div class="form-title">Form 990 (2010)</div>
      <div style="font-size: 10pt;">Page 2</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <div class="section-header">Statement of Program Service Accomplishments</div>
    <p><strong>1</strong> Briefly describe the organization's mission:</p>
    <p><span data-field="mission_statement_part2">{{ mission_statement_part2 }}</span></p>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <div class="section-header">Program Service Accomplishments</div>
    <p><strong>2</strong> Did the organization undertake any significant program services during the year which were not listed on the prior Form 990 or 990-EZ?</p>
    <table style="width: 100%;">
      <tr>
        <td style="width: 50%;">Yes</td>
        <td style="width: 50%;">No</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><span data-field="program_service_new_check_2">{{ program_service_new_check_2 }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="program_service_new_check_2_no">{{ program_service_new_check_2_no }}</span></td>
      </tr>
    </table>
    <p><strong>3</strong> Did the organization cause, conduct, or make significant changes in how it conducts, any program services?</p>
    <table style="width: 100%;">
      <tr>
        <td style="width: 50%;">Yes</td>
        <td style="width: 50%;">No</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><span data-field="program_service_change_check_3">{{ program_service_change_check_3 }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="program_service_change_check_3_no">{{ program_service_change_check_3_no }}</span></td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <div class="section-header">Program Service Accomplishments (Continued)</div>
    <p><strong>4</strong> Describe the exempt purpose achievements for each of the organization's three largest program services by expenses. Section 501(c)(3) and 501(c)(4) organizations and section 4947(a)(1) trusts are required to report the amount of grants and allocations to others, the total expenses, and revenue, if any, for each program service reported.</p>
    <table style="width: 100%;">
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th style="width: 5%;">4a</th>
          <th style="width: 20%;">Code:</th>
          <th style="width: 20%;">Expenses $</th>
          <th style="width: 20%;">Including grants of $</th>
          <th style="width: 20%;">Revenue $</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr class="line-item-row">
          <td></td>
          <td><span data-field="program_service_4a_code">{{ program_service_4a_code }}</span></td>
          <td><span data-field="program_service_4a_expenses">{{ program_service_4a_expenses }}</span></td>
          <td><span data-field="program_service_4a_grants">{{ program_service_4a_grants }}</span></td>
          <td><span data-field="program_service_4a_revenue">{{ program_service_4a_revenue }}</span></td>
        </tr>
        <tr class="line-item-row">
          <td><strong>4b</strong></td>
          <td>Code: <span data-field="program_service_4b_code">{{ program_service_4b_code }}</span></td>
          <td>Expenses $ <span data-field="program_service_4b_expenses">{{ program_service_4b_expenses }}</span></td>
          <td>Including grants of $ <span data-field="program_service_4b_grants">{{ program_service_4b_grants }}</span></td>
          <td>Revenue $ <span data-field="program_service_4b_revenue">{{ program_service_4b_revenue }}</span></td>
        </tr>
        <tr class="line-item-row">
          <td><strong>4c</strong></td>
          <td>Code: <span data-field="program_service_4c_code">{{ program_service_4c_code }}</span></td>
          <td>Expenses $ <span data-field="program_service_4c_expenses">{{ program_service_4c_expenses }}</span></td>
          <td>Including grants of $ <span data-field="program_service_4c_grants">{{ program_service_4c_grants }}</span></td>
          <td>Revenue $ <span data-field="program_service_4c_revenue">{{ program_service_4c_revenue }}</span></td>
        </tr>
        <tr class="line-item-row">
          <td><strong>4d</strong></td>
          <td>Other program services. (Describe in Schedule O.)</td>
          <td>Expenses $ <span data-field="program_service_4d_expenses">{{ program_service_4d_expenses }}</span></td>
          <td>Including grants of $ <span data-field="program_service_4d_grants">{{ program_service_4d_grants }}</span></td>
          <td>Revenue $ <span data-field="program_service_4d_revenue">{{ program_service_4d_revenue }}</span></td>
        </tr>
        <tr class="line-item-row">
          <td><strong>4e</strong></td>
          <td>Total program service expenses</td>
          <td><span data-field="program_service_4e_total_expenses">{{ program_service_4e_total_expenses }}</span></td>
          <td></td>
          <td></td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

</div>

<div class="page">
  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start;">
    <div>
      <div class="form-title">Form 990 (2010)</div>
      <div style="font-size: 10pt;">Page 3</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <div class="section-header">Checklist of Required Schedules</div>
    <table style="width: 100%;">
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th style="width: 5%;"></th>
          <th style="width: 50%;">Description</th>
          <th style="width: 10%;">Yes</th>
